Subject-level QC (`drop_subject_outliers`, `run_qc` with subject QC on, and `compute_subject_outlier_burden`) raises a `ValueError` saying how many observations have no subject. The container functions pooled observations without a subject into one subject named `'nan'`, counted and possibly dropped as a subject, and `compute_subject_outlier_burden` silently left them out. Epoch QC still runs and reports the subject counts as `None` while some subjects are unknown.
